# --- Scratch / ad-hoc analysis output (added 2026-09-30) ---
# Placement rule: throwaway analysis output belongs in the session scratchpad
# directory, NOT the repo root. These patterns are a safety net for what slips
# through, not a licence to keep writing scratch files here.
#   - reusable one-off scripts  -> tools/
#   - bug / test evidence       -> docs/evidence/   (KEPT, and tracked)
scratch_*
snap*.md
*_snapshot.md
.allure-results-*
out_*.txt

# NOTE: root-level evidence screenshots (bug_evidence_*.png, tc*.png, live_*.png)
# are deliberately NOT ignored — 24 of them are tracked and are attachments on
# filed Azure bugs. They are being relocated to docs/evidence/, not deleted.

# QA coverage baselines are COMMITTED - they are the anti-regression record
# (.claude/qa-baselines/<PBI>.json). Do not ignore them.

# Retired REST framework (qa/cms-automation/) was moved to _to_delete/ on
# 2026-08-18 — its orphan .env held real values while gitignored, invisible
# to any repo review. Delete _to_delete/ manually after confirming nothing
# in it is needed.
_to_delete/

# Generated, byte-exact image fixtures (PBI 129394 batch 1) -- rebuilt on
# demand by cms/tests/chambers_law/test_chambers_law_field_validation.py,
# never committed (they are multi-megabyte binaries).
cms/tests/chambers_law/fixtures/generated/

# Ad-hoc, per-run Allure output directories (allure-results/ is already
# ignored above; runs that target a named batch write siblings of it).
allure-results-*/
# Local QA Engine plugin checkout — a separate repo, accidentally committed
# as a bare gitlink (mode 160000) with no .gitmodules, which left every clone
# with an uninitialisable submodule. Untracked here on purpose.
AI-Plugin/
